Bundled third-party libraries (in the built .app under Contents/Frameworks):
libgphoto2, libgphoto2_port (LGPL-2.1-or-later), libexif (LGPL-2.1),
libltdl (LGPL-2.1), libusb (LGPL-2.1), libintl (LGPL-2.1),
libjpeg-turbo (IJG/BSD). They are shipped unmodified, dynamically linked and
replaceable; see https://github.com/gphoto/libgphoto2 for their sources.
